                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "488acfc3-0dd3-3133-a33e-778a408ba570",
                        "entry_id": "9b64455f-c8c8-3241-a632-12750cd134b9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "бессвязно, неразборчиво произносить"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "51ce2ba3-976e-4937-9348-3f5d6425f5bb",
                                "sense_id": "488acfc3-0dd3-3133-a33e-778a408ba570",
                                "text": "Когда маленькая подросла месяцев до восьми и начала что-то лепетать, важней всего для неё было освоить священное имя сестры."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "90546a2e-8363-3951-ae68-3c6d119b7a7d",
                        "entry_id": "9b64455f-c8c8-3241-a632-12750cd134b9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. говорить сбивчиво, с трудом подыскивая слова"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d9c99d3-a916-4589-bc11-3aee4657d250",
                                "sense_id": "90546a2e-8363-3951-ae68-3c6d119b7a7d",
                                "text": "— Васе высокоблагоуродие, заступитесь, спасите! — лепетал между тем несчастный жид, всею грудью прижимаясь к ноге Чертопханова, — а то они убьют, убьют меня, ваше высокоблагоуродие!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a2f0cece-1a7f-354a-9687-cab217cc2b09",
                        "entry_id": "9b64455f-c8c8-3241-a632-12750cd134b9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. разг. тихо, невнятно звучать"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "35c45b04-b0ad-4107-9e5b-e75809f6dfd4",
                                "sense_id": "a2f0cece-1a7f-354a-9687-cab217cc2b09",
                                "text": "Подавали уже свечи. Всё кругом шумело, лепетало."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5c9b400e-be1d-4430-810a-508b017a1464",
                        "source_entry_id": "9b64455f-c8c8-3241-a632-12750cd134b9",
                        "target_lang_word": "babble",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "babble",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5a81e53-403e-3305-abfe-8ef0b443f8c7",
                                        "entry_id": "3180c382-7cf2-3711-a8c7-32070c869f42",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To utter words indistinctly or unintelligibly; to utter inarticulate sounds"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a193d31e-8efa-4fef-b088-a258199d6910",
                                                "sense_id": "c5a81e53-403e-3305-abfe-8ef0b443f8c7",
                                                "text": "The men were babbling, so we couldn't make sense of anything."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c47b9baa-2f0e-332e-92e4-4a4dc73976cd",
                                        "entry_id": "3180c382-7cf2-3711-a8c7-32070c869f42",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To talk incoherently; to utter meaningless words."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c79109fb-d661-3c00-9758-f4a8acf17678",
                                        "entry_id": "3180c382-7cf2-3711-a8c7-32070c869f42",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To talk too much; to chatter; to prattle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25302be4-f21e-448d-a686-f6e33590dbcb",
                                                "sense_id": "c79109fb-d661-3c00-9758-f4a8acf17678",
                                                "text": "She babbled on for hours about the importance of some new gadget."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8e906d2-9612-4a7a-b541-b3608e07629f",
                                                "sense_id": "c79109fb-d661-3c00-9758-f4a8acf17678",
                                                "text": "Radical rather than rhetorical, babble like an oracle"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc4cf23d-6dbc-36b3-8685-1937c22652f0",
                                        "entry_id": "3180c382-7cf2-3711-a8c7-32070c869f42",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a continuous murmuring noise, like shallow water running over stones."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "329cdd9c-4482-4788-833f-570a45693ce7",
                                                "sense_id": "dc4cf23d-6dbc-36b3-8685-1937c22652f0",
                                                "text": "Hounds are said to babble, or to be babbling, when they are too noisy after having found a good scent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9fdb455-748e-461e-88b2-0676886465f9",
                                                "sense_id": "dc4cf23d-6dbc-36b3-8685-1937c22652f0",
                                                "text": "In every babbling brook he finds a friend."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36e3e448-085d-35bd-b189-d49c136d3bd5",
                                        "entry_id": "3180c382-7cf2-3711-a8c7-32070c869f42",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To utter in an indistinct or incoherent way; to repeat words or sounds in a childish way without understanding."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf1951c7-9d45-4f30-811c-032d04ed985c",
                                                "sense_id": "36e3e448-085d-35bd-b189-d49c136d3bd5",
                                                "text": "All this vvhile John had conn'd over ſuch a Catalogue of hard VVords, as vvere enough to conjure up the Devil; theſe he uſed to babble indifferently in all Companies, eſpecially at Coffee-houſes; ſo that his Neighbour Tradeſmen began to ſhun his Company as a Man that vvas crack'd."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d682684-06b9-39d9-b933-f540bdd3f16a",
                                        "entry_id": "3180c382-7cf2-3711-a8c7-32070c869f42",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To reveal; to give away (a secret)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "babble",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4e7c6fe-8c46-3897-88d0-854c232a0cdd",
                                        "entry_id": "055b559f-e87f-31e6-a26a-c4c94325685e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Idle talk; senseless prattle"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2b5a6f7-cffb-4834-b40d-3f24b49b9454",
                                                "sense_id": "a4e7c6fe-8c46-3897-88d0-854c232a0cdd",
                                                "text": "This is mere moral babble.",
                                                "translation": "Comus",
                                                "english": "Comus"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "685a07fb-8dd3-3d37-af34-bf10357e5881",
                                        "entry_id": "055b559f-e87f-31e6-a26a-c4c94325685e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inarticulate speech; constant or confused murmur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83e3dd33-3e95-4d1a-b387-ddd5aa6b48e5",
                                                "sense_id": "685a07fb-8dd3-3d37-af34-bf10357e5881",
                                                "text": "[M]an has an instinctive tendency to speak, as we see in the babble of our young children; whilst no child has an instinctive tendency to brew, bake, or write."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e422815-780f-3380-9203-3775f65a99cc",
                                        "entry_id": "055b559f-e87f-31e6-a26a-c4c94325685e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sound like that of water gently flowing around obstructions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c49b847d-9dc8-449f-b931-734ac7599a1a",
                                                "sense_id": "4e422815-780f-3380-9203-3775f65a99cc",
                                                "text": "[T]he babble of the stream / Fell, and without the steady glare / Shrank the sick olive sere and small."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f3df6978-26f2-49d4-bb3a-4f14df454ae4",
                        "source_entry_id": "9b64455f-c8c8-3241-a632-12750cd134b9",
                        "target_lang_word": "balbutier",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "balbutier",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f0b6f988-3d34-3d57-9cad-6373995f624f",
                                        "entry_id": "ab129e53-9c0a-3cc2-af82-adbfbbd12b23",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "S’exprimer ou prononcer difficilement, en hésitant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13f2d9b7-6a06-4cc2-a17b-968d7f2bd4d2",
                                                "sense_id": "f0b6f988-3d34-3d57-9cad-6373995f624f",
                                                "text": "Jean était effondré, il balbutia :\n– Mais, Geneviève... Ça n'est pas lui qui... C'est...\n– Ta ta ta taǃ Personne n'en sait rienǃ"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecbb66d7-8ded-4623-a76c-e334b560139d",
                                                "sense_id": "f0b6f988-3d34-3d57-9cad-6373995f624f",
                                                "text": "Quant à moi il n’y a qu’une seule chose qui m’effraye, c’est ma lenteur. Je crèverai que je n’aurai pas balbutié la moitié de ma pensée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f831a85-f609-49d5-8092-cbf9bc5f86aa",
                                                "sense_id": "f0b6f988-3d34-3d57-9cad-6373995f624f",
                                                "text": "C'est bon ! c’est bon ! se décida soudain à balbutier le second pochard en entraînant son compagnon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c501048-3ff0-4e7e-8482-736fcf48fb35",
                                                "sense_id": "f0b6f988-3d34-3d57-9cad-6373995f624f",
                                                "text": "Nous restions là à balbutier, elle avec un sourire un peu douloureux et son geste ancien de passer sa main sur son visage, soigneusement, comme pour en chasser un insecte invisible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d09aaff4-da1c-4ba5-965e-d97650cd6cca",
                                                "sense_id": "f0b6f988-3d34-3d57-9cad-6373995f624f",
                                                "text": "Qui se saoule toutes les nuits\nAvec du mauvais vin\nMais qu’on retrouve au matin\nDans l’église qui roupille\nRaide comme une saillie\nBlanc comme un cierge de Pâques\nEt puis qui balbutie\nEt qui a l’œil qui divague."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afee68a2-b0a1-43c3-b5ed-6c9b39a0702f",
                                                "sense_id": "f0b6f988-3d34-3d57-9cad-6373995f624f",
                                                "text": "Balbutier des excuses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "97153b47-a206-39a1-86d1-8a8ca5123834",
                                        "entry_id": "ab129e53-9c0a-3cc2-af82-adbfbbd12b23",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Agir difficilement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfecb857-4826-4df6-8700-9bd040e359e2",
                                                "sense_id": "97153b47-a206-39a1-86d1-8a8ca5123834",
                                                "text": "Aussi le Moyen-Âge est savant dans les langes, et encore au sein de sa nourrice morte, il balbutie confusément les choses passées."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
